---
import { company } from '../data/company';
---

<section class="contact-section" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <div class="section-label" data-reveal><span>CONTACT</span><span>お問い合わせ</span></div>
    <div class="contact-section__body">
      <h2 id="contact-title" data-reveal>つなぎたい相手を、<br />聞かせてください。</h2>
      <div class="contact-section__information" data-reveal>
        <p>展示会での通訳、社員の言語教育、人材育成など、<br class="desktop-break" />日本と海外をつなぐ取り組みについてご相談ください。</p>
        <a class="contact-section__phone" href={company.phoneHref}><span class="contact-section__tel" lang="en">TEL</span><span>{company.phone}</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" /></svg></a>
        <span class="contact-section__phone-note">電話をかける</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
